Unpublished work. © 2026 Siemens

• Select how you want to group the Workers. According to the:
◦ Pool, which uses the entire WorkerPool.
◦ Creation Table, which only uses the Workers contained in the Workers to Create table of the
WorkerPool.
• Select which statistics values for the Occupancy you want to show:
◦ Operational + failed shows the time during with the Worker was operational plus the time during
which he was failed.
◦ Overall Time
Note
To initially add the WorkerPools to the Chart, you can select them, drag them over the icon of the Chart
and drop them there.
