Mode [drop-down list] - Chart
Select the Mode with which the Chart updates the displayed data.
Remarks
You can select one of these settings:
• Sample Mode
Updates the Chart periodically after the interval you enter.
Type in the time span (Interval) after which the Chart takes the next sample.
• Watch Mode
Updates the Chart whenever the watchable input data changes.
The column Watchable in the window Show Attributes and Methods, shows the methods and
attributes which Plant Simulation can watch.
• Plot Mode
Updates the Chart whenever a simulation event takes place.
