3D Image Quality [drop-down list]
Select the 3D Image Quality with which the Chart shows the image in 3D.
Remarks
3D Image Quality is only available when you activate Display in Frame.
You can select one of these settings:
• High quality
Results in high resolution and improved image quality with bad performance.
• Balanced
Results in medium resolution, is a good compromise between image quality and performance.
• High performance
Results in low resolution and bad image quality with better performance.
High quality Balanced High performance
