Logarithmic Y-Axis
To activate Logarithmic scaling on the y-axis, select this check box.
Remarks
Logarithmic Y-Axis is useful if the data to be displayed is scattered across several orders of magnitude.
Logarithmic representation cannot show negative values.
Note
If you activate Logarithmic Y-Axis, you also have to type in a value greater than 0, for example 0.1, for
the Range Y, so that Plant Simulation can display the scale logarithmically.
