Legend
Select if and on which side of the Chart window Plant Simulation shows the legend for the values which
the Chart displays.
Remarks
You can select one of these settings:
• Off, i.e., no legend.
• On the Right, in one line.
• On the Right, in two lines.
• On the Right, stacked.
Shows the input channels from bottom to top instead of from top to bottom. It is especially well suited
for the Chart Types > Stacked Columns and 100 % Stacked Area.
• On the Left, in one line.
• On the Left, in two lines.
• At the Top, in one line.
• At the Top, in two lines.
• At the Bottom, in one line.
• At the Bottom, in two lines.
